.TH batten-provision 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-provision \- Pinned tools this repository provisions, cached out of tree
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten provision\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Pinned tools this repository provisions, cached out of tree
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
batten\-provision\-status(1)
Report which provisioned tools do not match the manifest
.TP
batten\-provision\-apply(1)
Fetch, verify against the pinned checksum, and install into the out\-of\-tree cache
.TP
batten\-provision\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
